{"conversation_id":"b168d44f-e0e3-41dc-a792-3e26a2d03f32","response":"Career development is a fascinating domain! I'd recommend establishing a clear professional roadmap. Set specific, measurable objectives and create a structured skill acquisition plan. Consider developing transferable skills that can adapt across different professional contexts.

